### RPE actuator endpoints
### Base URLs
@detectionBaseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@relayBaseUrl = http://localhost:8082
@alertBaseUrl = http://localhost:8083
@triageBaseUrl = http://localhost:8081

### Common auth header
@bearerToken = {{RPE_SCRAPE_JWT}}

### Detection service: liveness
GET {{detectionBaseUrl}}/actuator/health/liveness
Accept: application/json

### Detection service: readiness
GET {{detectionBaseUrl}}/actuator/health/readiness
Accept: application/json

### Detection service: health (requires auth)
GET {{detectionBaseUrl}}/actuator/health
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{bearerToken}}

### Detection service: info (requires auth)
GET {{detectionBaseUrl}}/actuator/info
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{bearerToken}}

### Detection service: prometheus (requires auth + metrics:scrape scope)
GET {{detectionBaseUrl}}/actuator/prometheus
Accept: text/plain
Authorization: Bearer {{bearerToken}}

### Relay service: health (requires auth)
GET {{relayBaseUrl}}/actuator/health
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{bearerToken}}

### Alert service: health (requires auth)
GET {{alertBaseUrl}}/actuator/health
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{bearerToken}}

### Triage service: health (requires auth)
GET {{triageBaseUrl}}/actuator/health
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{bearerToken}}
